# The evaluation hashes and diffs these files byte-for-byte, and patchkit reads
# and writes them without newline translation on purpose. Left to each machine's
# core.autocrlf, a Windows checkout would change those bytes — so a result would
# depend on which platform produced it. Pinning to LF makes a run reproducible
# across hosts rather than merely similar.
*.py     text eol=lf
*.yaml   text eol=lf
*.yml    text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.ini    text eol=lf
*.txt    text eol=lf
*.html   text eol=lf
*.css    text eol=lf
*.js     text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Not text: never touch these.
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.zip    binary
